@uaaUrl = https://mindset-development.authentication.us10.hana.ondemand.com
@clientId = sb-8fba328f-ec13-4450-b39a-dc1c8ba0197a!b624379|xsuaa!b49390
@clientSecret = eb941163-c0aa-4401-ae6e-f209a144cb01$JhACpHWF8jKtFbrhmC-gf71kGt-LcnKY2M6wkxLeP08=
@bpaUrl = https://spa-api-gateway-bpi-us-prod.cfapps.us10.hana.ondemand.com

### Step 1 — Get Token
# @name getToken
POST {{uaaUrl}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

###

### Step 2 — Get Definition ID
GET {{bpaUrl}}/workflow/rest/v1/workflow-definitions
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}

###

### Step 3 — Trigger BPA Directly
POST {{bpaUrl}}/workflow/rest/v1/workflow-instances
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "definitionId": "us10.mindset-development.employeeonboarding.employeeOnboardingApproval",
  "context": {
    "employeename": "John Doe",
    "employeeemail": "john@mindsetconsulting.com",
    "department": "IT",
    "role": "Developer",
    "startdate": "2026-08-01",
    "laptoprequired": true,
    "accesscardrequired": true,
    "remarks": "Test onboarding"
  }
}

###

### Step 4 — Create Onboarding Request via CAP
POST {{appUrl}}/odata/v4/onboarding/OnboardingRequests
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "John Doe",
  "employeeEmail": "john@mindsetconsulting.com",
  "department": "IT",
  "role": "Developer",
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "laptopRequired": true,
  "accessCardRequired": true,
  "remarks": "Test onboarding"
}

###

### Step 5 — Get All Onboarding Requests
GET {{appUrl}}/odata/v4/onboarding/OnboardingRequests
Authorization: Bearer {{getToken.response.body.access_token}}